[ti:Namaste Sada Vatsale Matribhume]
[ar:Akshay Pandya & Sushant Trivedi]
[al:RSS Prarthana]
[length:03:50]
[00:00.00](Music Introduction)
[00:20.00]Namaste sadaa vatsale mathru bhoome
[00:28.00]Twayaa Hindu bhoome sukham vardhitoham
[00:36.50]Mahaa mangale punya bhoome twadarthe
[00:44.50]Patatwesha kaayo namaste namaste
[00:52.50]Patatwesha kaayo namaste namaste
[00:59.00](Music)
[01:07.50]Prabho shaktiman Hindu raashtraanga bhoota
[01:15.50]Ime saadaram twaam namaamo vayam
[01:23.00]Twadeeyaaya kaaryaaya baddhaa kadeeeyam
[01:30.00]Shubhaam aashisham dehi thathpoortaye
[01:37.00]Ajayyaan cha vishwasya deheesha shaktim
[01:45.00]Susheelam jagadwena namram bhaveth
[01:52.00]Shrutham chaiva yath kanta kaa keerna maargam
[01:59.00]Swayam sweekritham na sukham kaarayeth
[02:06.00](Music)
[02:22.00]Samuthkarsha nishreya sasyaika mugram
[02:29.50]Param saadhanam naama veeravratam
[02:37.00]Thadantah sphuratwakshayaa dheya nishtaa
[02:44.00]Hridantah prajaa kartu theevraanisham
[02:51.50]Vijetri chana samhataa kaarya shaktir
[02:59.00]Vidhaayaasya dharmasya samrakshanam
[03:05.50]Param vaibhavam netum edat swaraashtram
[03:13.00]Samrthaa bhavatwaashishaa debhrusham
[03:22.50]Bharat Mata Ki Jay
[03:27.50](Music Outro)